    expression: 0
  - characterName: Alice
    dialogueText: (Menarik Nafaf Panjang)Huft. . . .Uwahh, rasanya udah mendingan
      sekarang..
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 9049539159198059528, guid: a5b0dcdf2040c7f4387b45e2aaec95cf, type: 3}
    expression: 0
  - characterName: Rian
    dialogueText: Nah kan, asal kamu mau terus terang bebanmu bisa terangkat
